{"page":5,"x":220.4,"y":407.9,"w":5,"s":"–"},
{"page":5,"x":228.8,"y":407.9,"w":176.5,"s":"All 4-WV and Moto/Quad Classes"},
{"page":5,"x":408.2,"y":407.9,"w":133.9,"s":"- You MUST ARRIVE at each"},
{"page":5,"x":50.4,"y":394.7,"w":507.5,"s":"checkpoint before closing time. If you are late AT ANY CHECKPOINT, you may be stopped and your race is"},
{"page":5,"x":50.4,"y":381.8,"w":446.9,"s":"over! Failure to stop as directed by SCORE official will result in disqualification and no points."},
{"page":5,"x":50.4,"y":362.9,"w":228.6,"s":"STAFFED CHECKPOINTS AND PENALTIES"},
{"page":5,"x":50.4,"y":346.9,"w":187.1,"s":"The penalty for missing a checkpoint is"},
{"page":5,"x":240.4,"y":346.9,"w":65.5,"s":"one (1) hour"},
{"page":5,"x":308.7,"y":346.9,"w":229,"s":"for each checkpoint missed. You are required to"},
{"page":5,"x":50.4,"y":333.8,"w":220.5,"s":"enter the coned area at Staffed Checkpoints at"},
{"page":5,"x":273.8,"y":333.8,"w":40.1,"s":"15 mph"},
{"page":5,"x":316.6,"y":333.8,"w":219.9,"s":"in a single file manner and follow directions of"},
{"page":5,"x":50.4,"y":320.8,"w":106,"s":"checkpoint personnel."},
{"page":5,"x":159.3,"y":320.8,"w":235.3,"s":"You must be prepared to stop if signaled to do so"},
{"page":5,"x":394.9,"y":320.8,"w":137.6,"s":". Failure to follow checkpoint"},
{"page":5,"x":50.4,"y":307.7,"w":261.8,"s":"personnel directions may result in additional penalties."},
{"page":5,"x":50.4,"y":288.7,"w":509.4,"s":"The checkpoint corridor is not considered part of the racecourse. Checkpoint speed zone is 150 feet before"},
{"page":5,"x":50.4,"y":275.8,"w":505.7,"s":"checkpoint and 100 feet after checkpoint. Entering and exiting all checkpoint zones must be done in a safe"},
{"page":5,"x":50.4,"y":262.7,"w":374.1,"s":"and prudent manner in order to guarantee the safety of all checkpoint workers."},
{"page":5,"x":50.4,"y":243.7,"w":505.3,"s":"Passing is not permitted in checkpoint speed zones. Pitting is not permitted within 300 feet before and 100"},
{"page":5,"x":50.4,"y":230.8,"w":108.7,"s":"feet after a checkpoint."},
{"page":5,"x":162,"y":230.8,"w":336.3,"s":"Penalty for speeding in a checkpoint zone is a minimum of 15 minutes!"},
{"page":5,"x":50.4,"y":211.7,"w":503.5,"s":"If you are signaled to STOP at a checkpoint and it is determined the unit failed to transmit tracking data as"},
{"page":5,"x":50.4,"y":198.7,"w":506.7,"s":"a result of physical damage or tampering, and you failed to stop on your own, a 15-minute penalty for each"},
{"page":5,"x":50.4,"y":185.8,"w":303.3,"s":"checkpoint you have passed without stopping will be assessed."},
{"page":5,"x":50.4,"y":166.7,"w":495,"s":"If you do not stop when signaled to do so, you will be assessed a 15-minute penalty for each checkpoint"},
{"page":5,"x":50.4,"y":153.7,"w":320.2,"s":"where you fail to STOP and no time credit will be given for the stop."},
{"page":5,"x":55.1,"y":132.6,"w":15,"s":"➔"},
{"page":5,"x":73.5,"y":132.6,"w":455.2,"s":"Missing a physical checkpoint is a one (1) hour penalty for each checkpoint missed"},
